# 🚗 Wahaan

A responsive automotive marketplace website built using HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, and JavaScript. The project provides a clean interface for browsing vehicles and automotive services.

## ✨ Features

- Responsive design
- Vehicle listings
- Modern UI
- Easy navigation
- Contact section

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Bootstrap
- JavaScript
- jQuery

## 🚀 Run Locally

1. Clone the repository:
```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/Wahaan.git
```

2. Open `index.html` in your browser or run with VS Code Live Server.

